  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Previously, back in the communal apartment, Arkady accidentally crushed Lyosha's plastic toy tank under his pillow and tried to calm the upset boy before he could call his mother. Meanwhile, out on a chilly city street, two men are loading heavy boxes and luggage into the trunk of a car.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ну ладно, не расстраивайся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здесь пока подождите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Мы вещи в машине забираем?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, в машине забирайте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Осторожно, этот ящик очень тяжёлый!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Держи крепче! Всё хорошо?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Да, держу нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сейчас ещё один ящик принесу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Давай быстрее, на улице холодно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сейчас будет совсем хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "А где твои тёплые перчатки?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ай, у меня перчаток нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Ладно, давай сюда скорее!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Отлично, закрывай скорее багажник!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's break down the dialogue between the two men loading the car.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ну ладно, не расстраивайся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, come on, don't be upset.' The negative imperative reassures someone who is worried.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здесь пока подождите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait here for now.' The adverb indicates a temporary pause while waiting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Да, в машине забирайте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, get it from the car.' The imperative tells him where to collect the items.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Осторожно, этот ящик очень тяжёлый!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Careful, this box is very heavy!' The short adjective describes the heavy load.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всё хорошо?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is everything okay?' A common Russian phrase asking if things are fine.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сейчас ещё один ящик принесу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will bring one more box now.' The adverb indicates an additional item coming.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Давай быстрее, на улице холодно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry up, it is cold outside.' The impersonal phrase describes the freezing weather.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Сейчас будет совсем хорошо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now it will be just right.' The future tense promises that the job will soon be done.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ай, у меня перчаток нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ow, I do not have gloves.' The negative construction uses the genitive case.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "man",
      "t": "Ладно, давай сюда скорее!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, give it here quickly!' The colloquial imperative urges him to hurry up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Отлично, закрывай скорее багажник!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
